cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use hf-data-agent, please cite the archived software release. After the first Zenodo release, replace the placeholder identifier with the Zenodo concept DOI."
type: software
title: "hf-data-agent: a Hugging Face backed RAG data agent"
abstract: "hf-data-agent is a Python research-software prototype for a retrieval-augmented data agent. It routes UI, HTTP API, MCP, and Slack entrypoints through one orchestrator; builds its knowledge base offline; queries warehouse and platform tools live; and supports mock, local Hugging Face Transformers, hosted Hugging Face Inference, and OpenAI-compatible model backends."
